Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:04.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎来到《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:06.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但其中一次约会必须在我纳帕的酒店工地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But one of the dates has to be at my hotel site in Napa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成交，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Done, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在回去干活吧，你个英国佬混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now just get back to work, you limey prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.21,0:00:12.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不如我们下一季偷偷塞个衍生剧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What if we backdoor a spin-off for next season?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.35,0:00:13.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就叫《皇家之恋》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We'll call it "Royal Love."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.75,0:00:15.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让他娶那个墨西哥比基尼模特，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You get him to marry the Mexican bikini model,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.68,0:00:17.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那这买卖就成了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you've got yourselves a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:19.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算我签了。行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Consider me signed. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:22.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我签约只做这一季。就一季，仅此而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I signed on for one season of this. One season, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不打算再留一季。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't intend to stick around for another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:25.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，假设我能把他劝回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's say I can turn him around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能得到什么？做买卖吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's in it for me? Wheeling and dealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要什么？我自己的节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want? My own show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.43,0:00:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿下《皇家之恋》。谈成这个节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take "Royal Love." Cut a deal for the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:32.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你坚持让他们在葡萄园拍摄，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you insist that they shoot it at the vineyard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拍成《皇家翻新》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as "Royal Renovations."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:37.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}选安娜。这主意其实不赖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pick Anna. It's actually not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜，我知道你和我之间有感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna, I know that you and I have a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.68,0:00:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你愿意嫁给我吗？愿意，愿意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you marry me? Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:51.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和莉齐分手了。你什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I broke up with Lizzie. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二轮之前你就要走？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you leaving before round two?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。我……杰里米……我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I... Jeremy... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋……天啊。这真是个天大的错误。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel... Oh, my God. This was a huge mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.58,0:01:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.59,0:02:00.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:03.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.62,0:02:06.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……和奎因在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I...was with Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:08.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:11.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我送你回家吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:13.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回哪儿，你家？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where, to your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.97,0:02:15.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:20.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好好洗个澡，睡张真正的床。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Take a real shower, sleep in an actual bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.61,0:02:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是要你搬进来什么的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not asking you to move in or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就一晚，别过得跟无家可归似的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just stop living like a homeless person for a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.52,0:02:34.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}戒指呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's the ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:38.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我摘了，行吗？我摘了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I took it off, okay? I took it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:40.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是，工作戴着太大了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's too big to wear at work, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得戴着戒指，宝贝。嘘。嘘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got to wear the ring, baby. Shh. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让全世界知道你就值这该死的十克拉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell the world you're worth 10 friggin' carats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.23,0:02:46.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方弄出来真棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This place turned out really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这都是你自己弄的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You do this all yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:51.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大部分是，嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mostly, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:54.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大概能让我保持理智吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess it keeps me sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:56.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你也没那么理智。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you're not that sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:59.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你……你还陪着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're... you're still with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:03.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.39,0:03:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得去冲个澡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to take a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:12.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。都归你用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. All yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.93,0:03:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:26.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有你在真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was right having you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.55,0:03:36.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:37.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，行，来吧，我们得小心点，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, all right, come on, we got to be careful, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我快到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我快到了。不，不。不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to get off. No, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要个孩子。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to make a baby. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:44.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:46.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说过你想要个孩子的。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said you wanted to make a baby. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:49.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:52.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:02.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了。嘿，宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Hey, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手机递给我，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hand me my phone, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:11.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回到《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome back to "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们到了……最后三位幸运女士，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And here we are... the final troika of lucky ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:17.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安娜、格蕾丝和费丝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anna, Grace, and Faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:18.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外面现在风好大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's so windy outside right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:21.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}本周，我们最后三位选手中的每一位\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This week, each one of our final three contestants
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都将有机会和亚当享受一次单独约会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is gonna get a chance to enjoy a solo date with Adam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:25.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在他的葡萄园里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}at his vineyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每一场约会都是向亚当展示\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Each one of these dates is a chance to show Adam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁是最适合他的伴侣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who is the best partner for him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:32.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在他开启为期一年的建设与改造之际，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as he embarks on a year of construction and overhaul,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:33.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这段旅程将被记录\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a journey that will be chronicled
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.01,0:04:37.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我们下一季的新节目……《皇家翻新》中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in our new show next season... "Royal Renovations."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:40.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这个……有格调，优雅，完全符合品牌调性。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at that... classy, elegant, totally on-brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:42.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}超级有格调。但这些约会结束时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Super classy. But at the end of these dates,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:46.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当将必须选出一位幸运女士\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam will have to choose one lucky lady
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与他共度浪漫一夜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to spend a romantic night alone with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为本周之后，各位，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because after this week, folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:52.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们将只剩下最后两位女士，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we're down to our final two women,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其中一位可能成为下一任亚当·克伦威尔夫人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}one of whom could be the next Mrs. Adam Cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.64,0:05:04.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿。你感觉怎么样？感觉不错。我感觉真的很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey. How you feeling? Feeling good. I'm feeling really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好，很好，因为你有很多活儿要干，知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's good, good, 'cause you got a lot of work to do, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:09.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得去现场，确保一切都达标。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got to get out there, and you got to make sure everything's up to snuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:11.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老兄，我知道怎么推销场地。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dude, I know how to sell a location.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好，因为我想让这个葡萄园成为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's good because I want this vineyard to be
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自上帝创造\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the most enticing vacation spot since God invented
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:15.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-斐济以来最诱人的度假胜地，好吗？  -我觉得不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-the Fijis, okay?   -Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:17.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会是很刺激的一年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna be an exciting year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:18.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。早上好，先生。早上好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Good morning, sir. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:20.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，嘿，瑞秋。哦！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hey, Rachel. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:21.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:24.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你一个人负责葡萄园的所有准备工作没问题吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, are you okay covering all the vineyard prep on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我得去洛杉矶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I got to go to L.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.79,0:05:27.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。我跟你一起去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Awesome. I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我带你去看看房子，然后，你知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll show you the house, and, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以挑挑灯具、瓷砖之类的玩意儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we can pick up fixtures and tiles and that kind of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，呃，其实，是，呃，是我要去看妇科医生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, uh, actually, it's, uh, it's a lady-doctor appointment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:35.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得去一趟。哦。哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that I need to take. Oh. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，嘿，关于孩子的事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, hey, about the baby thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个你不用担心，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't worry about that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我用仇恨性爱把我前妻搞怀孕了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I knocked up my ex-wife with hate sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:43.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想象一下我能为你做什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Imagine what I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.54,0:05:46.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我……我知道你能做什么，相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I... I know what you can do, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一路平安。我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Safe flight. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.65,0:05:52.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，嘿，麦迪逊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hey, Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:54.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特跟我说你干得很棒，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet tells me that you're doing a great job,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就继续保持现在这样就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so just keep doing whatever it is that you're doing.
