Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:12.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真不敢相信他们现在才告诉我们，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe that they're just telling us about it right now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:14.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。真够意外的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know. Shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。我最爱拆房子砸墙了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I just love demolition and busting up walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就喜欢那种事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just love that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.75,0:06:19.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打赌你确实喜欢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I bet you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.01,0:06:21.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她可不是唯一一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, she's not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}菲丝，你说得太对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Faith, you're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:25.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当需要的是真正的搭档，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What Adam needs is a real partner in this,
